    "role": "Qliphothic Vermin (Ghagiel — Lesser)",
    "tier": 1,
    "factionId": "",
    "notes": "<p>A thought, interrupted, given wings. Blinders flutter through the Wastes in disorienting swarms, drawn to any display of complex thought, planning, or manifestation. Their wings carry hypnotic, impossible patterns; their dissonant hum clouds the mind until simple deductions feel like mountain climbs. They don't want to kill you. They want you stupid.</p><p><strong>Qliphah:</strong> Ghagiel, the Obstructions — the Hull of Chokmah. Wisdom snuffed to stagnation.</p><p><em>Mal's note: 'If you suddenly can't remember why you drew your gun, shoot the moth. That IS why you drew your gun.'</em></p>",
